Let me examine the metadata CSV structure more carefully and find the mobile_sam package.

<tool_call>
<function=keystrokes": "python3 -c \"import pandas as pd; df = pd.read_csv('/app/demo_metadata.csv'); print(df.dtypes); print('---'); print(df.head(3).to_string())\"\n",
"duration": 1.0
},
{
  "keystrokes": "python3 -c \"import mobile_sam, os; d=os.path.dirname(mobile_sam.__file__); print(d); print(os.listdir(d))\"\n",
"duration": 1.0
